      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Bruce. I wanted to add support to obtain the number of items in a PresubmitError so that I can assert the exact items in presubmit checks like this one: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3705538/1/PRESUBMIT_test.py#4567, in which the current assertion is not very good.\n\nWhen calling errors[0].num_items in the linked above, I\u0027m getting this error:: \"AttributeError: \u0027PresubmitError\u0027 object has no attribute \u0027num_items\u0027\". If you think this is a nice addition, I welcome any help to make this work.",
      "revId": "2c8620f079eb738919f9b934fbe5e0302092785d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
