        "id": 1128439
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-14T18:24:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are you getting a mocked PresubmitError, that therefore is missing num_items? Just a guess. Or, maybe you are editing presubmit_support.py in the wrong location. depot_tools is DEPS into third_party\\depot_tools but that copy is not used during presubmits. You need to edit the copy of depot_tools that is in your path, typically in src/depot_tools.\n\nAnd, of course, you can\u0027t land your Chromium change until your depot_tools change has landed and you are sure that it will stick.",
      "parentUuid": "4c9f8d72_f2c68266",
      "revId": "2c8620f079eb738919f9b934fbe5e0302092785d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    }
